    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Intown, a city shrouded in nightmares<br><br>Intown is a city built around a science station where nightmares become reality. Follow how the impact of nightmares on Intown changes over time in seven unique stories, each taking place at a different time and place in the city, starting in the 70s and ending in 2025.<br><br>Explore a city filled with terror<br><br>Intown Nightmares features dark streets, creepy houses, and a gloomy forest. Explore the city to uncover its secrets and find a way out of the nightmare.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/8d5fbaa1e5d53d84109592e6e8758c92.poster.avif?t=1753448187\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/8d5fbaa1e5d53d84109592e6e8758c92.webm?t=1753448187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/8d5fbaa1e5d53d84109592e6e8758c92.mp4?t=1753448187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Solve puzzles and fight monsters<br><br>To survive in Intown, you'll have to solve puzzles and fight monsters in some stories. Use your weapons and wit to defeat enemies and find a way out of the nightmare.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/30ddb8517dde4878c21813258d8ba416.poster.avif?t=1753448187\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/30ddb8517dde4878c21813258d8ba416.webm?t=1753448187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/30ddb8517dde4878c21813258d8ba416.mp4?t=1753448187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Enjoy great graphics and music<br><br>Intown is a visually stunning game with pixelated graphics, cool lighting and elaborate textures. The soundtrack in the game is beautiful and dark, creating an unforgettable atmosphere.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/b6cbe529cda2b0180253249f1489709f.poster.avif?t=1753448187\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/b6cbe529cda2b0180253249f1489709f.webm?t=1753448187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779400/extras/b6cbe529cda2b0180253249f1489709f.mp4?t=1753448187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Solve the mystery of nightmares<br><br>What caused the nightmares in Intown? What is their purpose? Uncover the mystery of the nightmares and find a way to stop them before they destroy the town.<br><br>Intown Nightmares is a horror almanac that will leave you with an unforgettable experience. Follow seven unique stories, explore a city full of horror, meet unforgettable characters, solve puzzles and in some stories fight monsters. Uncover the mystery of nightmares and save Intown.<br><br>Game Features:<br><br>Seven unique stories taking place at different times and places in the city.<br>Exploration of the city filled with horror.<br>Puzzles and battles with monsters.<br>Great graphics and music.<br>Solving the mystery of nightmares and saving the city.",
